--[[
    MovementWaveUI.lua
    Original UI framework inspired by the structure/style requested by the user.
    Features:
      - Lucide icon pack via loadstring
      - Window + draggable frame
      - RightShift visibility toggle
      - X close button
      - Sidebar tabs + tab dividers
      - Independent invisible left/right scrolling columns
      - Sections
      - Button, Checkbox, Toggle, Keybind, Slider, Dropdown, Input,
        Colorpicker, Paragraph, Code, Divider, Space, Tag
      - Notifications, Dialogs, Popups
      - Theme customization
      - Callback + Set/Get/Lock/Unlock patterns

    Notes:
      - This file only builds UI/components and callback plumbing.
      - Game-specific behavior belongs in your callbacks.
]]

